              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "3 Jn 1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " The elder to the elect lady and her children, whom I love in the truth, and not only I but also all who know the truth, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2JN.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2JN.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2JN 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "because of the truth which abides in us and will be with us for ever:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2JN.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2JN.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2JN 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2JN.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2JN.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2JN 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Grace, mercy, and peace will be with us, from God the Father and from Jesus Christ the Father's Son, in truth and love.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2JN.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2JN.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2JN 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2JN.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2JN.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2JN 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I rejoiced greatly to find some of your children following the truth, just as we have been commanded by the Father. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2JN.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2JN.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2JN 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.13.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jn 13.34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " And now I beg you, lady, not as though I were writing you a new commandment, but the one we have had from the beginning, that we love one another. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2JN.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2JN.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2JN 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1JN.5.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Jn 5.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " And this is love, that we follow his commandments; this is the commandment, as you have heard from the beginning, that you follow love. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2JN.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2JN.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2JN 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1JN.2.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Jn 2.22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " For many deceivers have gone out into the world, men who will not acknowledge the coming of Jesus Christ in the flesh; such a one is the deceiver and the antichrist. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2JN.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2JN.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2JN 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Look to yourselves, that you may not lose what you",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2JN.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2JN.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1.8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Other ancient authorities read",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "we",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " have worked for, but may win a full reward. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2JN.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2JN.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2JN 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Any one who goes ahead and does not abide in the doctrine of Christ does not have God; he who abides in the doctrine has both the Father and the Son. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2JN.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2JN.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2JN 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If any one comes to you and does not bring this doctrine, do not receive him into the house or give him any greeting; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2JN.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2JN.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2JN 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for he who greets him shares his wicked work.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2JN.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2JN.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
